<!doctype html><html lang="en-CA"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="description" content="CommercialKonnect referral network for life insurance advisors working with Canadian business owners. Refer clients for commercial financing conversations with permission."/>
<title>Life Insurance Advisor Referrals | CommercialKonnect</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
</head><body>
<header><div class="shell nav"><a class="logo" href="https://commercialkonnect.ca">K<span>●</span> COMMERCIAL<b>KONNECT</b></a><nav><a href="#value">Partner benefits</a><a href="#why">Why finance matters</a><a href="#opportunities">Financing needs</a></nav><a class="btn ghost" href="#join">Become a partner ↗</a></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR LIFE INSURANCE ADVISORS · CANADA</p><h1>Your clients protect their business.<br/><em>Help them fund its future.</em></h1><p class="intro">Your business-owner clients trust you with protection decisions. When they are ready to expand, acquire, refinance or improve working capital, connect them to commercial financing expertise.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#join">Join the referral network ↗</a><a class="minor" href="#process">How referrals work ↓</a></div><p class="micro">Permission-first introductions · Your client relationship stays yours</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-top"><b>CK / PARTNER VIEW</b><span>ILLUSTRATIVE</span></div><small>BUSINESS GROWTH OPPORTUNITY</small><h2>One client.<br/>More ways to add value.</h2><div class="steps-mini"><p><strong>01</strong> Recognize a financing milestone <span>✓</span></p><p><strong>02</strong> Ask permission to introduce <span>✓</span></p><p><strong>03</strong> Connect to a finance specialist <span>↗</span></p></div></div></div></section>
<div class="ribbon"><div class="shell">BUSINESS FINANCING <span>·</span> COMMERCIAL MORTGAGES <span>·</span> WORKING CAPITAL <span>·</span> ACQUISITION CAPITAL</div></div>
<section class="section" id="value"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow dark">THE PARTNER ADVANTAGE</p><div class="heading"><h2>Be the advisor who sees<br/><em>the bigger picture.</em></h2><p>Life insurance conversations often reveal wider business priorities. Relevant introductions can add real value beyond the policy.</p></div><div class="cards">{benefits.map((b,i)=><article class="card"><span class="number">0{i+1} /</span><h3>{b.title}</h3><p>{b.body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section tint" id="why"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow dark">THE ECONOMIC RIPPLE EFFECT</p><div class="heading"><h2>When a business grows stronger,<br/><em>every advisor has more to protect.</em></h2><p>Appropriately structured finance can help a company invest and grow. Sustainable profitability, rather than borrowing alone, may create benefits across its professional advisory team.</p></div><div class="cards">{finance.map(item=><article class="card emphasis"><span class="number">{item.n} /</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.body}</p><div class="role"><strong>{item.audience}</strong><span>Additional relevant advisory conversations</span></div></article>)}</div><div class="banner"><p><b>The shared outcome:</b> A sustainably profitable business can deepen the value each trusted professional delivers.</p><a class="btn primary" href="#join">Explore a partnership ↗</a></div><p class="disclaimer">Financing does not guarantee growth, profitability or higher advisory fees. Each client's circumstances require independent assessment.</p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="opportunities"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow dark">WHEN TO REFER</p><div class="heading"><h2>Four moments worth<br/><em>starting a conversation.</em></h2><p>You do not need to pre-underwrite a business. Start with a legitimate goal and the client's interest in exploring options.</p></div><div class="op-grid">{opportunities.map(o=><article class="card"><div class="circle">↗</div><h3>{o.title}</h3><p>{o.body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark-section" id="process"><div class="shell process"><div><p class="eyebrow">SIMPLE BY DESIGN</p><h2>Good introductions.<br/><em>Clear boundaries.</em></h2><p>Professional relationships should be built on suitable, transparent client outcomes, not unsolicited sharing of private details.</p></div><div class="process-list">{['Recognize a business financing objective','Obtain the business owner’s express permission','Introduce the client to CommercialKonnect','Coordinate appropriate next steps and updates'].map((s,i)=><div><span>0{i+1}</span><strong>{s}</strong></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="join"><div class="shell join"><div><p class="eyebrow dark">BECOME A REFERRAL PARTNER</p><h2>Build a stronger<br/><em>business-owner network.</em></h2><p>Tell us about your practice. We will contact you about appropriate referral opportunities and the partnership process.</p><p class="disclaimer">Do not include client personal or financial details in this enquiry. Any referral compensation arrangement, where applicable, is subject to disclosure and regulatory review.</p></div><div class="form-panel"><h3>Partner enquiry</h3><p>For licensed insurance professionals serving Canadian businesses.</p><form id="partner-form"><div class="two"><label>Full name *<input name="full_name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"/></label><label>Work email *<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email"/></label></div><label>Agency or practice *<input name="agency" required maxlength="160"/></label><div class="two"><label>Province *<select name="province" required><option value="">Select province</option>{['British Columbia','Alberta','Ontario','Saskatchewan','Manitoba','Quebec','Nova Scotia','New Brunswick','Newfoundland and Labrador','Prince Edward Island','Yukon','Northwest Territories','Nunavut'].map(p=><option value={p}>{p}</option>)}</select></label><label>Client focus<select name="client_focus"><option value="">Select focus</option><option>Small business owners</option><option>Incorporated professionals</option><option>Mid-market businesses</option><option>Business succession</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div><label>Tell us about your practice<textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1200"></textarea></label><label class="trap" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I agree that CommercialKonnect may contact me about this partnership enquiry. This is not consent for marketing to my clients.</span></label><button type="submit" class="btn primary" id="submit">Send partner enquiry ↗</button><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></div></section>
</main><footer><div class="shell foot"><b>COMMERCIAL<span>KONNECT</span></b><p>Business funding conversations for Canadian business owners and their trusted advisors.</p><a href="https://commercialkonnect.ca">commercialkonnect.ca</a></div></footer>
<script>
 const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#partner-form'),status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#form-status'),button=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#submit');
 form?.addEventListener('submit',async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();if(!form||!status||!button)return;button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Sending…';const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());try{const r=await fetch('/api/partner-enquiry',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(data)});const body=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(body.error||'Submission failed');status.textContent='Thank you. Your partner enquiry was received.';form.reset()}catch(e){status.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Unable to send. Please try again.'}finally{button.disabled=false}});
</script>
<style>
:root{--navy:#071d30;--ink:#102c3c;--teal:#159c8d;--muted:#5e7782;--light:#eef6f4}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font:15px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.shell{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px;min-height:82px}.logo{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-size:18px}.logo span,.logo b{color:var(--teal)}nav{display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}header{background:var(--navy);color:white}.btn{border:0;border-radius:5px;display:inline-block;font-weight:800;padding:15px 21px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.btn.primary{background:#49ceba;color:#072c35}.btn.ghost{border:1px solid #66808b;background:transparent;color:white}.hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 35%,#176173 0,transparent 50%),var(--navy);color:white;padding:95px 0 110px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{color:#64d9c7;letter-spacing:.15em;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.eyebrow.dark{color:#078779}h1,h2,h3{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,4.4vw,61px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:24px 0}h1 em,h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#59cfbd}.intro{color:#bad0d7;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;max-width:640px}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px;margin:30px 0}.minor{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.micro{font-size:11px;color:#9bb5be}.panel{background:#f8ffff;color:var(--ink);padding:33px;transform:rotate(-2deg);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 30px 85px #0006}.panel-top{border-bottom:1px solid #d9e9ea;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:18px;font-size:10px}.panel-top span{color:var(--teal)}.panel>small{display:block;margin-top:25px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.panel h2{font-size:28px;margin:13px 0 30px}.steps-mini p{border-top:1px solid #dce9eb;padding:17px 0;margin:0;font-size:12px}.steps-mini strong{color:var(--teal);margin-right:10px}.steps-mini span{float:right;color:var(--teal)}.ribbon{background:#e1f2ef;padding:22px;text-align:center;color:#1b645f;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.07em}.ribbon span{margin:0 15px}.section{padding:100px 0}.heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:50px;align-items:end;margin:10px 0 44px}.heading h2,.process h2,.join h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,45px);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.23;margin:0}.heading h2 em,.join h2 em{color:#108a7e}.heading>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;max-width:380px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.card{background:#f7faf9;border:1px solid #e0ebea;padding:31px;min-height:246px}.card h3{font-size:19px;margin:32px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.035em}.card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted)}.number{font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800}.tint{background:var(--light)}.emphasis{background:white;min-height:370px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.emphasis .role{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid #e1eae9;padding-top:16px;display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.role strong{color:#0d897d}.banner{background:var(--navy);color:white;margin-top:28px;padding:25px 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px}.banner p{line-height:1.8;font-size:13px}.disclaimer{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.op-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.op-grid .card{background:#fff}.circle{background:#dff5f0;color:var(--teal);display:grid;place-items:center;width:45px;height:45px;border-radius:50%;font-size:22px}.dark-section{background:var(--navy);color:white}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:100px}.process h2{margin:25px 0}.process p{color:#a8c3cd;line-height:1.9}.process-list>div{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #325062;padding:23px 0}.process-list span{color:#56cbb9;font-weight:800}.join{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:95px;align-items:start}.join h2{margin:25px 0}.join>div>p{line-height:1.9}.form-panel{background:#f5f9f8;padding:36px;box-shadow:0 12px 45px #0d394018;border-radius:8px}.form-panel h3{font-size:22px;margin:0}.form-panel>p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin:17px 0}input:not([type=checkbox]),select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid #cbdcda;background:white;padding:13px;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;margin-top:8px}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}.consent{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}.consent input{margin-top:2px}.trap{position:absolute;left:-9999px}button:disabled{opacity:.65}#form-status{color:#087f74;font-size:13px}footer{background:#061725;color:white;padding:46px 0}.foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px}.foot b{font-family:Manrope}.foot span{color:#5dd9c4}.foot p{color:#91aab4;font-size:12px;flex:1}.foot a{font-size:12px;color:#66d9c8}@media(max-width:950px){.hero-grid,.process,.join{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.op-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.panel{transform:none}.heading{display:block}.heading>p{max-width:620px}.emphasis{min-height:0}.banner{display:block}.banner .btn{margin-top:12px}}@media(max-width:650px){nav,.nav .ghost{display:none}.hero{padding:65px 0}h1{font-size:41px}.section{padding:70px 0}.op-grid,.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.banner{padding:22px}.ribbon{line-height:2}.foot{display:block}.form-panel{padding:23px}.actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}
</style></body></html>
